[4c311cbee]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.stable.mono - Windows 10 (build 19044) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7270) - AMD Ryzen 9 5900HS with Radeon Graphics (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe Godot Editor struggles to detect unexpected external file name changes if the UID file is not renamed at the same time.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ff627707-6000-4215-aad7-b9b16aa18b7f\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a new empty project.  \n2. Create a GDScript file.  \n3. Rename this GDScript file outside of the editor.  \n4. Return to the editor.  \n5. Note that the editor has deleted the original UID file but has not generated a new one for the GDScript file with the new name.  \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nAn empty project","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104188/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":1,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket"